{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21880374",
      "title": "Understanding Mixin Merging",
      "lectureOrder": 313,
      "videoOrder": 279,
      "sourceHash": "cc79e093626b10722ade8bfbd0be5126fc3adf89cf3e54acd0ef01429d9b0ed0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "Mixins can be powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 5.89,
          "en": "when working with the options API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.89,
          "end": 7.91,
          "en": "as you saw in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.91,
          "end": 9.59,
          "en": "it's always important though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.59,
          "end": 12.73,
          "en": "to be aware of how mixins are merged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.73,
          "end": 15.45,
          "en": "with the options you define in your components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 18.86,
          "en": "where you use them. Thus far, I only have one mixin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.86,
          "end": 22.27,
          "en": "in each component and I got no other options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.27,
          "end": 25.513,
          "en": "besides the components option in those components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.47,
          "end": 28.1,
          "en": "Now you could add more mixins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.1,
          "end": 31.05,
          "en": "but you could also have more component options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.05,
          "end": 34.51,
          "en": "And let's say I also had a data option here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.51,
          "end": 36.41,
          "en": "in the delete user component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.41,
          "end": 41.41,
          "en": "And in there I return a data object with some other data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.15,
          "end": 45.7,
          "en": "maybe with the alert title, let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.7,
          "end": 48.51,
          "en": "Delete user. That could be my title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.51,
          "end": 52.47,
          "en": "And now I wanna bind alert title to title prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.47,
          "end": 54.193,
          "en": "on my user alert component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.37,
          "end": 57.56,
          "en": "Of course we can do this with a colon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.56,
          "end": 59.98,
          "en": "and then point at alert title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.98,
          "end": 62.633,
          "en": "which now is a data property of this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.88,
          "end": 66.02,
          "en": "There's just one important question.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.02,
          "end": 71.02,
          "en": "Will this work after all the mixin also provides some data?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.46000000000001,
          "end": 74.45,
          "en": "So which data wins the one of the mixin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.45,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "or the one of the lead user. And if one of the two wins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 81.03999999999999,
          "en": "does that mean that the other functionality breaks?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.03999999999999,
          "end": 85.1,
          "en": "Well, let's see. If I reload and I click delete user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.1,
          "end": 87.97,
          "en": "the alert opens, and we see that title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.97,
          "end": 91.22,
          "en": "which I just defined as a data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.22,
          "end": 93.28,
          "en": "of the delete user component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.28,
          "end": 96.45,
          "en": "So actually no data option wins",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.45,
          "end": 99.12299999999999,
          "en": "instead vue merges the data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100,
          "end": 101.06,
          "en": "And that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.06,
          "end": 104.86,
          "en": "This is a built in mechanism when you have a mixin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.86,
          "end": 109.77000000000001,
          "en": "the options exposed by the mixin are merged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.77000000000001,
          "end": 112.453,
          "en": "with the options you have in your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.39,
          "end": 116.09,
          "en": "So for example, here in the alert mixin,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.09,
          "end": 119.24000000000001,
          "en": "I have this alert is visible data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.24000000000001,
          "end": 121.53,
          "en": "And by default, it's false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.53,
          "end": 123.82,
          "en": "Now this is merged with my component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.82,
          "end": 124.97,
          "en": "and the data for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.97,
          "end": 127.78,
          "en": "in the end my component has this property as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.78,
          "end": 129.603,
          "en": "because I'm applying this mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.98,
          "end": 134.57,
          "en": "But I could also add the same data property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.57,
          "end": 138.28,
          "en": "cue the data of delete user, and set it to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.28,
          "end": 140.93,
          "en": "which is a different value than applied in the mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.23,
          "end": 143.713,
          "en": "And if I do that and save it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.68,
          "end": 147.05,
          "en": "we see when I reload my app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.05,
          "end": 149.27,
          "en": "this alert is opened by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.27,
          "end": 152.25,
          "en": "So this means that my component option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.25,
          "end": 154.15,
          "en": "where I set this to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.15,
          "end": 157.53,
          "en": "hence making sure that the alert is opened by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 162.42000000000002,
          "en": "this component option overrides the option set by the mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.42000000000002,
          "end": 165.57,
          "en": "And that's indeed how vue merges mixins",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.57,
          "end": 167.489,
          "en": "with component options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.489,
          "end": 171.31,
          "en": "The component options win if there is a clash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.31,
          "end": 174.82,
          "en": "By default, data is simply combined, but if you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.82,
          "end": 176.73,
          "en": "like, we have it here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 179.57999999999998,
          "en": "the same data property in your component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.57999999999998,
          "end": 183.79,
          "en": "as you have it in a mixin, the component option wins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.79,
          "end": 184.923,
          "en": "not the mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.923,
          "end": 187.25,
          "en": "This is how you merge the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.25,
          "end": 188.993,
          "en": "between component and mixin.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
